Base hosts a vibrant DeFi ecosystem, with protocols like Uniswap, Aave, and Curve deploying on the network. Ripe’s unique lending model complements these platforms by offering users a way to unlock liquidity from their portfolios without selling assets. For instance, a user could deposit ETH and tokenized RWAs into Ripe on Base, borrow stablecoins, and use them to trade on Uniswap or stake in Curve, all within the same low-cost ecosystem.

